Evaluation
Submissions are evaluated using RMSE (Root Mean Squared Error):


This metric penalizes large outliers, challenging you to create a model that is robust across all product categories.

Submission File
For each row_ID —which represents a unique combination of item_id, store_id, and date— you must predict the value for the demand variable. The submission file must include a header and follow this format:

row_id,demand
0,3
1,1
2,5
...
